   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Redacted prompts and who sent them: **Langfuse** -> Traces -> filter by tag `secrets-redacted` (per type: `secret:aws_access_key`, `secret:password_assignment`, ...). The secret itself is never stored; only `[REDACTED_<TYPE>]`. Switch to blocking with `SECRETS_GUARDRAIL_MODE=block` (ops/gateway/compose.yml)."
